# Week 6 analytics output — contains real position sizes, cost basis and P&L.
# Excluded by default because this repo is intended to be shown publicly.
# Remove these two lines if you decide the numbers are fine to publish.
projects/05-portfolio-database/results/*
# ...except the two charts referenced by WEEK6_SUMMARY.md, which are
# generated in indexed form (latest = 100) and carry no account values.
!projects/05-portfolio-database/results/portfolio_value.png
!projects/05-portfolio-database/results/sector_exposure.png

# Editor/agent local config. Excluded because launch.json here points at an
# absolute path in a different project (~/Desktop/tailguard) and is specific to
